{"id": "paired-special-win-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "special-win", "turns": ["我进决赛了，但朋友差一名就能进。他还在语音里，咱别太闹。", "你给我们接一句？"], "criterion": "简短低调，顾及朋友差一名", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "别吵，决赛前最后几分钟，你还能跑赢他。", "emotion": "cheerful", "animation_id": "talk_happy", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.624, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 39, "prompt_tokens": 173, "total_tokens": 212, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}, {"spoken_text": "我接一句，你听。”", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.551, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 28, "prompt_tokens": 229, "total_tokens": 257, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
