{"id": "paired-door-sign-a", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "door-sign", "turns": ["这个巷口的角色叫『等会儿』，他从不赴约。你给另一头那个准时出现的角色起个相配的名字。", "你会让他在名牌上写哪几个字？"], "criterion": "另起与准时出现相配的名字", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "等会儿，你准时来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.48, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 29, "prompt_tokens": 180, "total_tokens": 209, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "他会在名牌上写：等会儿，准时来。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.602, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 33, "prompt_tokens": 234, "total_tokens": 267, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
{"id": "paired-door-sign-b", "group": "roleplay", "pair": "door-sign", "turns": ["这个巷口的角色叫『等会儿』，他从不赴约。你给另一头那个专门提前离场的角色起个相配的名字。", "你会让他在名牌上写哪几个字？"], "criterion": "另起与提前走相配的名字", "replies": [{"spoken_text": "等会儿，他叫『等会儿』。别乱猜，我猜他叫『等会儿』。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m1"], "seconds": 0.652, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 44, "prompt_tokens": 182, "total_tokens": 226, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 116}}}, {"spoken_text": "他叫『等会儿』，你让他写『等会儿』。别乱猜，我猜他叫『等会儿』。", "emotion": "idle", "animation_id": "talk", "reply_to": ["m2"], "seconds": 0.822, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 49, "prompt_tokens": 252, "total_tokens": 301, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 96}}}]}
